# Line endings are LF in the repository and on every checkout, Windows included: tests hash
# file contents and the shell scripts must run under Git Bash.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files are never normalized or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff2 binary

